DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the biggest fight of our lives. Time to join Field 
 Team 6's free Text on Tap text team - and text millions of unregistered li
 kely Democrats in key swing states to win key elections in 2026! We love f
 ree texting! We call it Text on Tap\, and it's the new and improved versio
 n of BYOP. It uses an anonymized Google Voice or TextNow number. It's a gr
 eat way to register new Democrats! There are a few things you'll need to s
 et up on your computer but they aren't difficult\, and we provide all 
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ft6/event/405150/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
