 n%20Image%201_20231214173802957298.png
DESCRIPTION:This a local Indivisible event! Join IndiMarin for our monthly
  State of Play virtual call as we preview the electoral landscape for the 
 2026 Midterm election. Winning back control of Congress is critical to sav
 ing our democracy and ending the abuses of the Trump Administration. To do
  that\, we need to be informed about the electoral dynamics. Our electoral
  team will brief us on the issues and events that will decide this histori
 c election. Then\, we will share information on volunteer opportunitie
LOCATION:Virtual event
